# T183 (owner request, Block A of the device session): the source and the changelog lines of the detail page are links. A tap asks "Open this link?" and
# shows the real address; Cancel changes nothing; Open hands the address to the reader's browser (on the computer nothing is opened) and the page stays.
# The store itself never fetches a link (FR-043): this walk proves only the asking and the wiring.
# scenario demo
size 1404 1872
wait 400
tap refresh
waitfor catalogLine Catalog last updated
waitfor appRow
tap appRow 0
waitfor detailLicense
expect_absent linkAsk
expect detailSource https://
shot @OUT@/70-detail.png

# the source line asks first, with the address in full
tap detailSource
waitfor linkAsk Open this link?
expect linkAddress https://
shot @OUT@/71-link-ask.png
# Cancel closes the question and nothing else happens
tap linkCancel
expect_absent linkAsk
expect_absent linkFailed
expect detailLicense MIT

# the changelog line asks too; Open closes the question and reports no failure
tap detailChangelog
waitfor linkAsk Open this link?
tap linkOpen
expect_absent linkAsk
expect_absent linkFailed
expect detailLicense MIT
tap back
waitfor appRow
quit
